---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { capabilities } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BIDBOX — 용역분야에 전문화된 입찰서비스"
  description="정보 나열이 아니라, AI로 예상 입찰가까지 제시합니다. 공공조달 입찰 데이터를 읽고 낙찰금액을 예상하는 BIDBOX."
  variant="bidbox" active="bidbox"
>
<section class="navy-field">
        <div class="wrap grid items-center gap-12 pb-[clamp(48px,7vw,88px)] pt-[clamp(56px,9vw,110px)] lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
          <div>
            <span class="tag rise">용역 분야 전문</span>
            <h1 class="display rise rise-2 mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,5.2vw,4rem)]">
              용역분야에 전문화된<br />입찰서비스
            </h1>
            <p class="lede rise rise-3 mt-6">
              정보 나열이 아니라, AI로 <strong style="color:var(--bb-accent)">예상 입찰가까지</strong> 제시합니다.
              근로자파견 · 경비업 · 위생관리용역업 · 직업소개업에 특화된 데이터로 예측합니다.
            </p>
            <div class="rise rise-4 mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/bidbox/pricing/">프로그램 접속</a>
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/bidbox/demo/">데모 신청</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6! sm:p-8!" style="background:rgba(21,24,28,0.86);border-color:var(--bb-border)">
            <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">예측 결과</p>
            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4">
              <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 border-b pb-4" style="border-color:var(--bb-border)">
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">공고</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 font-bold">2026년 시설 경비 용역</p>
                </div>
                <p class="num text-sm" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">용역 · 서울</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">AI 예상 낙찰금액</p>
                <p class="num mt-2 text-[clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem)] font-black" style="color:var(--bb-accent)">₩418,200,000</p>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="rounded-xl p-4" style="background:rgba(184,221,240,0.07)">
                  <p class="text-xs font-bold" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">기초금액</p>
                  <p class="num mt-1 font-bold">₩452,000,000</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl p-4" style="background:rgba(184,221,240,0.07)">
                  <p class="text-xs font-bold" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">예상 낙찰률</p>
                  <p class="num mt-1 font-bold">92.5%</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">
                예측값은 공고 · 낙찰 이력과 시장 동향을 함께 분석한 결과이며, 산출 근거를 같은 화면에서 확인할 수 있습니다.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="highlights">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2 id="highlights" class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">BIDBOX가 하는 일</h2>
          <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
            {capabilities.map((capability) => (
              <article class="card card-lift">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.02em]">{capability.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.75]" style="color:var(--bb-muted)">
                  {capability.body}
                </p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          <a class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold" style="color:var(--bb-accent)" href="/bidbox/service/">
            서비스 자세히 보기
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
</BaseLayout>
